        "r": 555.2646900000004,
        "b": 304.97291
      },
      "content": "Risk of damage to the mechanical seal or shaft sleeve on units supplied with cartridge mechanical seals. Prior to startup, make sure to tighten the set screws in the seal locking ring and remove the centering clips."
